      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "Core roles: only the identity lines above feed them. Neutral paper and graphite surfaces.",
      "notes": {
        "field": "The well: segmented and switch tracks, pressed buttons, selected radio cards, and disabled fields.",
        "field-bg": "Fields (input, select, textarea, search): a white fill with a faint edge in light, the sunk well in dark.\nDark fields stay sunk in the well. It sits within about 1.01:1 of the canvas, so the edge carries the shape.",
        "nav-current": "Selected rows lift and take a faint accent tint, so the selection reads on near-white panels too.",
        "nav-current-text": "Text on the current nav row, selected tab, and selected list row: the first of --accent, --text, black, and white\nthat reaches 4.5:1 over --nav-current, on the page and on a surface.",
        "segmented-current-text": "The selected segmented label: the first of --accent, --text, black, and white that reaches\n4.5:1 on the thumb. An icon-only option needs 3:1."
      },
      "tokens": {
